Hi Chunyang,

Thanks for your interest in Canopy and truly sorry for my late reply. We’ve encountered a potential issue in transforming the B allele frequency and the log-r ratio values from Sequenza to WM and Wm matrices, due to the ploidy issue. However, as stated in our manual, “The B-allele frequency is Bf = Wm / (WM + Wm) and the depth ratio is depth.ratio = (WM + Wm)/2. From here the input matrix WM and Wm can be calculated. “. Maybe you can try Falcon or Falcon-X? This is by default the caller in our pipeline MARATHON https://github.com/yuchaojiang/MARATHON.

Hope this can be helpful to you.
Yuchao

